{"seq":1,"slug":"measuring-disease-frequency","title":"大学公共卫生与预防医学 — 疾病频率与分布的测量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/public-health/epidemiology/measuring-disease-frequency","wordCount":2061,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学公共卫生与预防医学-疾病频率与分布的测量\">大学公共卫生与预防医学 — 疾病频率与分布的测量</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>流行病学的第一步永远是&quot;测量&quot;——在你能解释为什么人群会生病之前，必须先精确地知道有多少人病了、病得多重、谁在生病。这听起来简单，但魔鬼藏在细节里：同样是&quot;得病的人数除以总人数&quot;，分母里该不该包括已经死掉的人、分子里该不该包括去年就已经患病的人，这些选择会导致完全不同的结论。流行病学之所以成为一门科学，正是因为它把这些看似琐碎的定义问题处理得极其严谨。</p>\n<p>测量疾病频率的核心概念有三组：<strong>发病率</strong>（incidence，衡量新发病例出现的速度）、<strong>患病率</strong>（prevalence，衡量某一时点存在的病例总量）和各类<strong>死亡率</strong>（mortality）。理解它们的区别是整个流行病学的基础——把患病率误当成发病率，是初学者最常犯也最致命的错误。一个简单的比喻：如果把疾病比作浴缸里的水，发病率是水龙头流入的速度，死亡和康复是排水口流出的速度，而患病率是浴缸里此刻积存的水量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"发病率-衡量-新发-的速度\">发病率：衡量&quot;新发&quot;的速度</h3><p>发病率衡量一段时间内<strong>新发</strong>病例的出现频率，它直接反映疾病发生的风险。最常用的两种形式是累积发病率和发病密度。</p>\n<p><strong>累积发病率</strong>（Cumulative Incidence，又称发病风险）的公式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>观察期内新发病例数</mtext><mtext>期初无病的人群总数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CI = \\frac{\\text{观察期内新发病例数}}{\\text{期初无病的人群总数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期初无病的人群总数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">观察期内新发病例数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>举例：某校 1000 名健康学生，一学年内有 50 人新患流感，则累积发病率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50/1000 = 0.05 = 5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50/1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span>。它回答的是&quot;一个人在这段时间内得病的概率有多大&quot;。</p>\n<p>但累积发病率有个隐含假设：所有人都被完整观察了整个时间段。现实中人们会中途退出、死于其他原因、或在不同时间加入研究。这时需要用<strong>发病密度</strong>（Incidence Density，又称发病率），分母改为&quot;人时&quot;（person-time）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>新发病例数</mtext><mtext>所有个体的观察人时之和</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ID = \\frac{\\text{新发病例数}}{\\text{所有个体的观察人时之和}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">所有个体的观察人时之和</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新发病例数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果甲被观察了 2 年、乙 3 年、丙 5 年（共 10 人年）期间出现 2 例新病例，则发病密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/10 = 0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2/10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> 例/人年。人时的妙处在于：观察 100 人 1 年，和观察 50 人 2 年，提供的信息量是等价的（都是 100 人年）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"患病率-衡量-现存-的负担\">患病率：衡量&quot;现存&quot;的负担</h3><p><strong>患病率</strong>衡量某一时点或时期内人群中<strong>现存</strong>病例（新旧都算）的比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>某时点现存病例数</mtext><mtext>该时点人群总数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\frac{\\text{某时点现存病例数}}{\\text{该时点人群总数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">该时点人群总数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">某时点现存病例数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>患病率反映的是疾病对人群造成的现存负担，对卫生资源规划极为重要——一个城市要配置多少糖尿病管理床位，取决于患病率而非发病率。</p>\n<p>发病率、患病率与病程之间有一个优雅的近似关系（在稳态条件下）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\approx I \\times D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是平均病程。这个公式解释了一个反直觉的现象：当一种致命病的治疗手段改进、患者活得更久（病程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 变长）时，即使发病率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 不变，患病率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 反而会上升。艾滋病就是典型——抗逆转录病毒疗法让感染者寿命大幅延长，结果全球 HIV 感染者的患病人数不降反升，这并非防控失败，而是治疗成功的副产品。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三类指标的区别一览\">三类指标的区别一览</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>分子</th>\n<th>分母</th>\n<th>反映什么</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>累积发病率</td>\n<td>新发病例</td>\n<td>期初无病人数</td>\n<td>个体患病风险</td>\n<td>暴发疫情、固定队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发病密度</td>\n<td>新发病例</td>\n<td>观察人时</td>\n<td>患病速度</td>\n<td>长期随访、人员流动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>患病率</td>\n<td>现存病例</td>\n<td>时点总人口</td>\n<td>现存疾病负担</td>\n<td>资源规划、慢性病</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死亡率</td>\n<td>死亡数</td>\n<td>平均人口</td>\n<td>死亡风险</td>\n<td>人群健康总评</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"死亡相关指标\">死亡相关指标</h3><p>死亡率家族里有几个容易混淆的成员：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>粗死亡率</strong>（Crude Mortality Rate）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>某年死亡总数</mtext><mtext>年中人口数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{某年死亡总数}}{\\text{年中人口数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">年中人口数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">某年死亡总数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，通常以&quot;每 10 万人&quot;表示。</li>\n<li><strong>病死率</strong>（Case Fatality Rate）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>某病死亡数</mtext><mtext>该病患者数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{某病死亡数}}{\\text{该病患者数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">该病患者数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">某病死亡数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，反映疾病的凶险程度。狂犬病发病后病死率近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span>，而季节性流感约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1%</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>婴儿死亡率</strong>（Infant Mortality Rate）：每千名活产婴儿中 1 岁内死亡数，是衡量一国卫生水平的金标准指标。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个关键陷阱是<strong>粗率的可比性问题</strong>。日本的粗死亡率高于很多发展中国家，难道日本人更不健康？恰恰相反——日本老龄化严重，老年人口占比高，自然死亡更多。要公平比较不同人口结构的群体，必须做<strong>标准化</strong>（standardization），即统一年龄结构后再比较，得到&quot;标化死亡率&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[新发病例] --&gt;|流入| B[现存病例池&lt;br/&gt;患病率]&#10;    B --&gt;|康复| C[痊愈]&#10;    B --&gt;|死亡| D[死亡率]&#10;    A -.发病率.-&gt; B\">graph LR\n    A[新发病例] --&gt;|流入| B[现存病例池&lt;br/&gt;患病率]\n    B --&gt;|康复| C[痊愈]\n    B --&gt;|死亡| D[死亡率]\n    A -.发病率.-&gt; B</pre><h3 id=\"一个经典案例-约翰-斯诺的霍乱地图\">一个经典案例：约翰·斯诺的霍乱地图</h3><p>1854 年伦敦霍乱暴发，约翰·斯诺并没有显微镜也不知道霍乱弧菌，但他做了一件流行病学奠基性的工作：他把每个死亡病例标在地图上，计算不同供水公司服务区域的死亡率。供水来自污染河段的 Southwark 公司用户死亡率，是来自清洁上游的 Lambeth 公司用户的近 9 倍。这个比较率的思想——把死亡数除以对应的人群规模，再做组间对比——正是现代流行病学测量的雏形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>某社区有 5000 人，年初有 200 名高血压患者，这一年新诊断了 60 例。请分别计算这一年的累积发病率和年初患病率，并解释两者的实际含义有何不同。</li>\n<li>为什么&quot;癌症患病率上升&quot;未必意味着&quot;癌症发病率上升&quot;？请用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\approx I \\times D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系给出至少两种解释。</li>\n<li>A 国粗死亡率为 9‰，B 国为 7‰，能否据此断定 B 国居民比 A 国更健康？需要补充什么信息？</li>\n<li>病死率高的疾病一定比病死率低的疾病造成更多死亡吗？请举一个反例说明。</li>\n<li>在一次为期 3 个月的传染病暴发调查中，你应该优先报告累积发病率还是发病密度？为什么？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>真实连接：每次看到新闻里&quot;某传染病致死率 X%&quot;时，留意它说的是&quot;病死率&quot;还是&quot;人群死亡率&quot;——媒体经常混淆，导致公众对风险产生巨大误判，新冠疫情初期的&quot;致死率&quot;争论就是典型。</li>\n<li>经典著作：Gordis《流行病学》（中文版）前几章对发病率与患病率的讲解被公认为最清晰。</li>\n<li>工具资源：世界卫生组织 Global Health Observatory 数据库提供各国标化死亡率，可亲手对比&quot;粗率&quot;与&quot;标化率&quot;的差异。</li>\n<li>历史延伸：阅读约翰·斯诺《论霍乱的传播方式》原始记述，体会在病原体未知时代如何仅凭测量与比较锁定病因。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本课时的核心是建立&quot;测量先于解释&quot;的流行病学思维。你需要牢牢区分三个最易混淆的概念：发病率衡量新病例的产生速度，患病率衡量现存病例的总负担，死亡率衡量死亡风险；它们由病程通过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\approx I \\times D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 相联系。同时要警惕粗率在不同人口结构间的不可比性，标准化是解决之道。掌握这些测量工具后，下一课时我们将进入&quot;研究设计&quot;——学习如何用队列研究和病例对照研究，从这些测量数字中追溯疾病的病因。建议复习时，亲手用一组真实数据把本课所有指标各算一遍。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学公共卫生与预防医学 — 疾病频率与分布的测量","id":"大学公共卫生与预防医学-疾病频率与分布的测量"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"发病率：衡量\"新发\"的速度","id":"发病率-衡量-新发-的速度"},{"level":3,"text":"患病率：衡量\"现存\"的负担","id":"患病率-衡量-现存-的负担"},{"level":3,"text":"三类指标的区别一览","id":"三类指标的区别一览"},{"level":3,"text":"死亡相关指标","id":"死亡相关指标"},{"level":3,"text":"一个经典案例：约翰·斯诺的霍乱地图","id":"一个经典案例-约翰-斯诺的霍乱地图"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"大学公共卫生与预防医学 — 流行病学研究设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/public-health/epidemiology/study-designs"}}